---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AffiliateButton from '../components/AffiliateButton.astro';
import ZoneMap from '../components/ZoneMap.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Where to Stay in Burgas 2027 | Arena Accommodation & Hotels" 
  description="Discover the best places to stay for Eurovision 2027 in Burgas. From arena walking-distance hotels to coastal shuttle towns like Pomorie and Sozopol."
>
  <div class="container page-content">
    <h1 class="text-gradient">Burgas 2027 Accommodation Hub</h1>
    <p class="lead">Where to stay during the biggest event of the year? We break down the map so you don't end up stranded.</p>

    <div class="content-grid">
      <div class="main-column">
        <ZoneMap />

        <section class="glass-panel mb-4">
          <h2>📍 Area 1: Arena Burgas Walking Distance</h2>
          <p>The premium choice for hardcore fans looking for <strong>hotels walking distance to arena burgas</strong>. Prices will be highest here, but you'll save hours on late-night transit after the Grand Final.</p>
          <div class="insider-note">
            <strong>Insider Note:</strong> Look for apartments in the <em>Izgrev</em> and <em>Zornitsa</em> neighborhoods. They are directly adjacent to the Arena.
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="glass-panel mb-4">
          <h2>🏖️ Area 2: Sea Garden & City Center</h2>
          <p>Perfect if you want to combine Eurovision with a beach holiday. You'll need a 15-minute taxi or bus ride to the Arena, but you get direct access to the EuroVillage, clubs, and the best seafood restaurants.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="glass-panel">
          <h2>🚐 Area 3: Coastal Alternatives</h2>
          <p>Towns like <strong>Pomorie, Sarafovo, and Nessebar</strong> offer cheaper rates and beautiful sea views. However, you MUST arrange a reliable transfer back after midnight.</p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <aside class="sidebar">
        <div class="glass-panel sticky-box">
          <h3>Secure Your Stay</h3>
          <p>Availability is dropping rapidly. Check real-time prices now:</p>
          <AffiliateButton text="Search Booking.com" href="#" provider="booking" />
          
          <hr style="margin: 24px 0; border-color: var(--glass-border);" />
          
          <h4>Want the Secret List?</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">We are negotiating direct rates with local apartment owners. Subscribe to get the drop.</p>
          <form onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('Subscribed!');" style="display:flex; gap:8px;">
            <input type="email" placeholder="Your email" required style="width:100%; padding:8px; border-radius:4px; border:1px solid var(--glass-border); background:rgba(0,0,0,0.5); color:#fff;" />
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding:8px 12px; font-size:0.8rem;">Join</button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-content {
    padding: 64px 24px;
  }
  
  h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .mb-4 {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  h2 {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .insider-note {
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-amber);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .sticky-box {
    position: sticky;
    top: 100px;
  }

  .sticky-box h3 {
    color: var(--accent-magenta);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .content-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
